              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "et_pb_row_7",
          "hiddenOn": [],
          "columns": [
            {
              "size": "1_2",
              "modules": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "et_pb_text_3",
                  "html": "<h5>From the A1 southbound</h5> <ul> <li>Leave at junction 34, on A614 Bawtry.</li> <li>In Bawtry at the traffic lights turn left for Gainsborough A631.</li> <li>In the village of Eveton take a right turn by The Sun Inn to Mattersey.</li> <li>In the village of Mattersey take the first left past the post office signposted Sutton cum Sound.</li> <li>Follow the road out of the village for half a mile.</li> <li>Blaco Hill Farm Cottages is on the left hand side before the hill.</li> </ul>",
                  "hiddenOn": []
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "size": "1_2",
              "modules": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "et_pb_text_4",
                  "html": "<h5>From the A1 northbound</h5> <ul> <li>Leave at the junction signed Retford A620 and turn left for Retford.</li> <li>Follow the road for approx 2 miles and take a left turn to Suttom cum Lound.</li> <li>Follow this road over the canal and railway to the crossroads.</li> <li>Go straight on into thevillage of Sutton and pass through.</li> <li>Follow the road for approx 1.5miles, Blaco Hill Farm Cottages is on the right hand side just past the bend over a hill.</li> </ul>",
                  "hiddenOn": []
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
